  "note": "Independent re-judgment against RFC 4271 Section 5.1.2(a) ('When a given BGP speaker advertises the route to an internal peer, the advertising speaker SHALL NOT modify the AS_PATH attribute associated with the route.') after adding emitPrePolicyAdjRIBOut in reactorAPIAdapter.forwardUpdateSection (reactor_api_forward.go) for RFC 8671 Section 5.2. The added 4-line guard runs before orderedEgressSteps when !mods.IsWithdraw() and copies sourceWire.Payload() read-only for BMP pre-policy Adj-RIB-Out observation; it does not mutate sourceWire, mods, isEBGP/IsIBGP classification, runEgressPolicyChain, AS_PATH preservation toward internal peers, or AS_PATH prepending toward external peers. All fourteen tagged tests and every other cited producer/helper are byte-identical to the prior enforced audit, so the enforced verdict and its prior baseline scope and discrimination provenance remain valid.",
